# ATTACK SPELLS 

[SPELL]
<SPHERE>:ATTACK
<NAME>:Lento
<TARGET_ALIGNMENT>:EVIL
<TARGET>:CHARACTER
<CAST_TIME>:1
<MANA>:10
<ICON>:ICONS/spellslow.png:ICONS/spellslowa.png
<DESCRIPTION>:Rallenta il bersaglio al 60%\ndella velocità per 10 secondi\n+1 secondo di durata per livello di abilità attacco

[EFFECT]
<NAME>:SLOW
<EXCLUSIVE>:1
<MESSAGE>:Rallentato!
<ACTIVATION>:USAGE
<TYPE>:PERCENTSPEED
<DURATION>:10
<VALUE>:-40
<DURATION_BONUS>:1
[/EFFECT]

[EFFECT]
<NAME>:SLOWATTACK
<EXCLUSIVE>:1
<ACTIVATION>:USAGE
<TYPE>:PERCENTATTACKSPEED
<DURATION>:10
<VALUE>:-40
<DURATION_BONUS>:1
[/EFFECT]

